/// <summary>
/// Repository Processing Agent - cAST-based RAG System
/// Implements CAST (Chunking via Abstract Syntax Trees) from EMNLP 2025
/// 
/// Architecture:
/// 1. cAST Chunking: Split-then-merge algorithm (max_chunk_size=2000 chars)
/// 2. Graph Storage: Memgraph (structure, relationships)
/// 3. Vector Storage: Qdrant (semantic search via embeddings)
/// 4. Hybrid Retrieval: Graph queries + Vector similarity
/// 
/// Paper: https://aclanthology.org/2025.findings-emnlp.430.pdf
/// </summary>

